QuestGuidance.Register("en",464,{
[14817]="7005A9B8\n1\tStand at the first location\tThe first location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should stand at the first location. 'As you were walking, you got to where you needed to go with me by your side.' This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tStand at the second location\tThe second location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should stand at the second location. 'I bear the symbol of your line and kept you safe during the war.' This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tStand at the third location\tThe third location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should stand at the third location. 'As chance would have it, I have broken the lines and turned the tides of battle.' This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tStand at the fourth location\tThe fourth location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should stand at the fourth location. 'As chance would have it, I have both pierced the skin of the enemy, and sliced an apple for a meal.' This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tStand at the fifth location\tThe fifth location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should stand at the fifth location. 'I was there when the first tree fell to build your home.' This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tStand at the sixth location\tThe sixth location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should stand at the sixth location. 'I was there when you struck the nails that would hold your home together.' This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tStand at the seventh location\tThe seventh location can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should stand at the seventh location. 'I have found all that remains just out of your grounded grasp.'\n8\tCollect the Jewel of Masal\tThe Jewel of Masal can be found in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should collect the Jewel of Masal.\n9\tAdd the Jewel of Masal to the Throne of Zidir-nesad\tThe Throne of Zidir-nesad can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should add the Jewel of Masal to the Throne of Zidir-nesad under Rísti Graver's supervision.\n10\tTalk to Rísti Graver\tRísti Graver can be found at the Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rísti Graver.\n",
[14818]="7006BCC2\n1\tTravel to Zikrum-dûl to search for the ancient relics\tAngârmu has asked you to travel to Zikrum-dûl and recover various ancient relics that hold great value.\n2\tGather a pouch ritual spices\030Find a flask of ancient elixir\030Collect a pouch of precious gems\tGather the ancient relics that Angârmu asked for from Zikrum-dûl.\n3\tReturned to Angârmu with the collected items\tReturn to Angârmu in Malgâma with the ancient relics gathered from Zikrum-dûl.\n",
[14819]="7005874C\n1\tDestroy supplies and weapon racks\tSupplies and weapon racks can be found in and near Zudramdân. You should destroy supplies and weapon racks.\n2\tDestroy supplies (total: 10)\030Destroy weapon racks (total: 6)\tSupplies and weapon racks can be found in and near Zudramdân. You should destroy supplies and weapon racks.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many supplies and weapon racks at Zudramdân.\n",
[14820]="700156AE\n1\tTalk to Águti at the Rotting Cellar camp\tÁguti is at the Rotting Cellar camp in the Water-works, far south-west of the Twenty-first Hall. Simbi has asked you to speak with Águti regarding the progress of the expedition in the Water-works.\n",
[14821]="70050A15\n1\tDefeat Mithrin wolverines\tWolverines have taken refuge at Óinsbridge.\n2\tDefeat Mithrin wolverines (total: 10)\tWolverines have taken refuge at Óinsbridge.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many wolverines at Óinsbridge.\n",
[14822]="700509C2\n1\tCollect Ungoladan-weapons (total: 8)\tGather Ungoladan-weapons.\n2\tCompleted\tGather Ungoladan-weapons.\n",
[14823]="700509C6\n1\tDefeat Ungoladan invaders in Óinsbridge (total: 20)\tDefeat Ungoladan invaders in Óinsbridge.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeat Ungoladan invaders in Óinsbridge.\n",
[14824]="700509C3\n1\tDefeat Helghúr\tDefeat Helghúr in Óinsbridge.\n2\tTalk to Stráhek the Stout\tYou should return to to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and let him know of your victory at Óinsbridge.\n",
[14825]="7006EC0D\n1\tMount a race-horse\030Mount a race-pony\tThe Hamâti steeds can be found spoiling for the race in the stable east of The Cracked Flagon. You should mount a steed to begin the race -- a pony if you are shorter in stature, or a horse if you are of a taller build. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tCross the starting line to begin the race\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tRace to the first gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tRace to the second gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tRace to the third gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tRace to the fourth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tRace to the fifth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tRace to the sixth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tRace to the seventh gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tRace to the eighth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. Here you must choose to follow the beach or go up the hill. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n11\tRace to the ninth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n12\tRace to the tenth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n13\tRace to the eleventh gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n14\tRace to the twelfth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n15\tRace to the thirteenth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n16\tRace to the fourteenth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n17\tRace to the fifteenth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n18\tRace to the sixteenth gate\tThe gates can be found by following the path around Furtherholm. You must race through all the gates before the timer runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n19\tCross the finish line before the time runs out\tThe finish line is near! You must cross the finish line before the time runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n20\tTalk to Nârud, the Shield Isles Race Marshal\tNârud, the Shield Isles Race Marshal, stands next to the finish line at the race-track at the south-east end of Furtherholm. You should speak with Nârud and inform him of your success.\n",
[14826]="700739EC\n1\tPick up Daffodil Days banners\tMayor Malmadog invited you to place the banners around Clegur in his stead. You should pick up the stack of banners near the fence in front of the mayor's smial.\n2\tPlace Daffodil Days banners (quantity: see journal)\tMayor Malmadog invited you to place the banners around Clegur in his stead. You should place the banners in various locations around the village.\n3\tTalk to Mayor Malmadog\tYou have placed the Daffodil Days banners around the village of Clegur. You should return to Mayor Malmadog and let him know the job is done.\n",
[14827]="700739ED\n1\tPick daffodils around Clegur (total: 8)\tAthra has asked you to pick some nice-looking daffodils so you can transplant them into the empty planters found in front of various smials.\n2\tPlant daffodils in containers (quantity: see journal)\tYou have picked some nice-looking daffodils from around Clegur. Now you should transplant them into the empty planters found in front of various smials.\n3\tTalk to Athra Devister\tYou have picked some nice-looking daffodils and transplanted them into the empty planters found in front of various smials. You should return to Athra Devister near Clegur's stables.\n",
[14828]="700739EE\n1\tTalk to Cunedda Moltgig\tRosentyl has asked you to get the ingredients she needs to make cawl. The butcher, Cunedda Moltgig, should have some lamb for her. You should go into Clegur's butcher shop and talk to Cunedda.\n2\tCollect a package of lamb meat\tClegur's butcher, Cunedda Moltgig, has indicated that you can take the meat reserved for Rosentyl from the table inside the butcher shop.\n3\tTalk to Gloron Magimrud\tRosentyl has asked you to get the ingredients she needs to make cawl. Gloron Magimrud, at the farm atop the hill in Clegur, should have some vegetables for her.\n4\tCollect carrots\030Collect potatoes\tGloron Magimrud has said you can take some of the potatoes and carrots from his harvest, beside him in Clegur's fields.\n5\tTalk to Bortho Bishel, the Provisioner's Assistant\tRosentyl has asked you to get the ingredients she needs to make cawl. She said you can talk to the provisioner's assistant about getting some leeks. You should talk to Bortho Bishel, in front of the Boat and Basket tavern.\n6\tCollect leeks\tBortho Bishel, the Provisioner's Assistant, has said that you can take some leeks from the crate on the waggon beside the Provisioner.\n7\tBring the ingredients to Rosentyl Flutch\tYou have collected all of the ingredients Rosentyl Flutch needs to make cawl. You should bring them to her in front of her home in Clegur.\n",
[14829]="700739EF\n1\tUse the Map to Clegur\tHughbert cannot visit Clegur himself because he has too much work, and has given you a map to the town so you can go there if you choose. You should use the Map to Clegur in your inventory.\n2\tTravel to Clegur\tHughbert cannot visit Clegur himself because he has too much work, and has given you a map to the town so you can go there if you choose.\n3\tTalk to Athra Devister\tAs you arrived in Clegur with the help of the map given to you by Hughbert, a hobbit waved to you. You should go talk to her.\n",
[14830]="70073A09\n1\tPick up the packaged lamb meat\tCunedda Moltgig, Clegur's butcher, asked for your help in delivering packages of lamb meat to those that ordered them. You should pick up the packages from the table inside the butcher shop.\n2\tDeliver lamb meat to Leri Grudd\030Deliver lamb meat to Mayor Malmadog Torlan\030Deliver lamb meat to Delyth Saethur\030Deliver lamb meat to Drudwen\030Deliver lamb meat to Gloron Magimrud\030Deliver lamb meat to Welduth Lhush\tYou have the packages of lamb meat that Cunedda said needs to be delivered to various residents of Clegur. You should bring each package to the person who ordered it.\n3\tTalk to Cunedda Moltgig\tYou have delivered all of the packages of lamb meat for Clegur's butcher. You should return to Cunedda Moltgig inside his shop and let him know that the job is completed.\n",
[14831]="70073A0B\n1\tFind the lute\030Find the fiddle\030Find the bagpipes\030Find the bodhran\030Find the flute\tYou have been asked... in a way, to help the band recover their instruments. You should look around Clegur for musical instruments or suspicious activity.\n2\tReturn the fiddle to the fiddler\030Return the bagpipes to the piper\030Return the bodhran to the drummer\030Return the flute to the flautist\tYou have found the instruments belonging to Chubanog's Gleemen scattered around Clegur. You should return the instruments to their owners, waiting in front of the Boat and Basket tavern.\n3\tReturn the lute to the lutenist\tYou have found the instruments belonging to Chubanog's Gleemen scattered around Clegur. You should return the lute to the lutenist, waiting in front of the Boat and Basket tavern.\n",
[14832]="70073AE4\n1\tMaramam has offered to give you a free slice of her delicious pie if you hand out fliers to visiting hobbits scattered around Clegur.\t\n2\tTalk to Maramam Bobbid\tYou have handed out all of the fliers Maramam gave you to advertise her pie. You should return to her near the stable-master in Clegur to receive your tasty reward.\n",
[14833]="70073AE5\n1\tFind the water buckets near the pond\tLeri has asked you to water the daffodils around the village of Clegur. You should go to the pond across from her smial and find a bucket to use.\n2\tCollect a water bucket\tYou have found the buckets that Leri said you could use. You should take a bucket and use it to water the daffodils in Leri's yard in Clegur.\n3\tCollect another water bucket\tLeri has asked you to water the daffodils around the village of Clegur. You should get another bucket and water the daffodils next to the beehives in Clegur, near the butcher shop.\n4\tCollect another water bucket\tLeri has asked you to water the daffodils around the village of Clegur. You should get another bucket and water the daffodils near the stable-master in Clegur, across from the Boat and Basket.\n5\tCollect another water bucket\tLeri has asked you to water the daffodils around the village of Clegur. You should get another bucket and water the daffodils in front of Delyth Saethur's smial, between the river and the Boat and Basket in Clegur.\n6\tCollect yet another water bucket\tLeri has asked you to water the daffodils around the village of Clegur. You should get another bucket and water the daffodils behind the oven, near Clegur's farming fields.\n7\tTalk to Leri Grudd\tYou have watered the daffodils around the village of Clegur. You should return to Leri Grudd, in front of her home in Clegur.\n",
[14834]="70073AE8\n1\tTalk to Welduth Lhush\tNaffa has asked you to talk to Welduth Lhush, a Stoor reputed to have the best daffodils and the festival, and ask her if you can trade for some bulbs.\n2\tTalk to Gloron Magimrud\tWelduth agreed to trade some daffodil bulbs in exchange for Gloron Magimrud's secret to growing carrots. You should talk to Gloron Magimrud in the farming fields of Clegur.\n3\tTalk to Malmadog Torlan\tGloron has told you that he will give you the secret to his high-quality carrots if you get a daffodil banner and place it by the barn. You should talk to Clegur's Mayor, Malmadog Torlan, to see if you can get another banner.\n4\tPlace the banner in front of the barn\tMayor Malmadog has given you a daffodil banner. You should place it in the ground in front of the large barn by Clegur's farming fields.\n5\tTalk to Gloron Magimrud\tYou have placed a daffodil banner in front of the barn, as Gloron Magimrud asked. You should talk to Gloron, still in the fields.\n6\tTalk to Welduth Lhush\tGloron Magimrud has shared his secret to growing good carrots with you. You should return to Welduth Lhush in front of her home in Clegur and tell her.\n7\tCollect the prized daffodil bulbs\tWelduth Lhush has relented and said you can take the pot of her prized daffodil bulbs to her left. You should collect the bulbs so you can give them to Naffa Blodven.\n8\tGive the bulbs to Naffa Blodven\tYou have gotten some daffodil bulbs from Welduth Lhush. You should bring them to Naffa Blodven near Clegur's stable-master.\n",
[14835]="70073AEA\n1\tComplete Daffodil Days (Daily) (total: 7)\tAthra Devister asks if you would be able to help with Daffodil Days for a week.\n",
[14836]="70073AEB\n1\tComplete Quest: The Gift of Spring\030Complete Quest: Family Feast\030Complete Quest: Stretched Too Thin\030Complete Quest: Musicians' Misfortune\030Complete Quest: Well-watered Blooms\030Complete Quest: Promoting Pie\030Complete Quest: Flower Envy\030Complete Quest: Springtime's Colours\tAthra Devister, the organizer of Clegur's Daffodil Days festival, has promised you a reward if you lend a hand with the festival while you're here.\n2\tTalk to Athra Devister\tYou have helped many people around Clegur during Daffodil Days. You should return to Athra Devister near the stables and let her know.\n",
[14837]="70073BC5\n1\tDefeat Badharál the Gorger\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n2\tDefeat Maukhorn\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n3\tDefeat the Legion of Lhaereth\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n4\tDefeat Zamâktar the Putrescent\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n5\tCompleted: Conquering the Folly of Nagakhêdi (Tier 1)\tYou have completed the Folly of Nagakhêdi on Tier 1.\n",
[14838]="70073BC6\n1\tDefeat Badharál the Gorger\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n2\tDefeat Maukhorn\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n3\tDefeat the Legion of Lhaereth\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n4\tDefeat Zamâktar the Putrescent\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n5\tCompleted: Conquering the Folly of Nagakhêdi (Tier 3)\tYou have completed the Folly of Nagakhêdi on Tier 3.\n",
[14839]="70073BC7\n1\tDefeat Badharál the Gorger\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n2\tDefeat Maukhorn\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n3\tDefeat the Legion of Lhaereth\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n4\tDefeat Zamâktar the Putrescent\tMany challenges bar your way deeper into the Folly of Nagakhêdi.\n5\tCompleted: Conquering the Folly of Nagakhêdi (Tier 2)\tYou have completed the Folly of Nagakhêdi on Tier 2.\n",
[14840]="70073C91\n1\tMeet Faeron outside the Folly of Nagakhêdi\tFaeron and Rhadrog have traveled to Adagím to investigate the threat that may be inside the abandoned wonder. You should travel to the Folly of Nagakhêdi and talk to Faeron.\n2\tComplete The Folly of Nagakhêdi raid on any difficulty\tFaeron, Rhadrog, and the Kinta Irsinith will venture into the ancient citadel in Adagím to search for the source of the blight. You should use the Instance Finder to complete The Folly of Nagakhêdi raid on any difficulty.\n3\tTalk to Faeron\tYou have thwarted the plans of Lhaereth the Stained and prevented her from unleashing an ancient Balrog on Mûr Ghala. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[14841]="70073DAD\n1\tComplete the Treasure Caves of Hurum Kâna (Solo)\tThe merchant Katâl has requested your aid in bringing Bârlat the Bold to justice. Bârlat can be found in the caves above Katâl.\n2\tSpeak with Katâl near the treasure caves\tYou have defeated Bârlat and his brigands and retrieved the riches of Kighân. Return with the merchant Katâl beneath the falls with these riches and your report.\n",
[14842]="70073DBD\n1\tComplete Mûr Ghala instances (total: 6)\tComplete Instances in the Mûr Ghala Cluster for the Quartermaster. Use the Instance Finder to enter Mûr Ghala Instances.\n2\tSpeak with a Mûr Ghala Quartermaster for your reward\tSpeak with a Mûr Ghala Quartermaster in Adagím or Zajâna to accept your reward.\n",
[14843]="70073DBE\n1\tComplete the Treasure Caves of Hurum Kâna (Tier 3)\030Complete Kôth Rau, the Wailing Hold (Tier 3)\030Complete Ekal-nêbi, the Fallen Palace (Tier 3)\tComplete dangerous Instances in the Mûr Ghala Cluster for the Quartermaster. Use the Instance Finder to enter Mûr Ghala Instances.\n2\tSpeak with a Mûr Ghala Quartermaster for your reward\tSpeak with a Mûr Ghala Quartermaster in Adagím or Zajâna to accept your reward.\n",
[14844]="70073DBF\n1\tDefeat Badharál the Gorger on Tier 3\030Defeat Maukhorn on Tier 3\030Defeat the Legion of Lhaereth on Tier 3\030Defeat Zamâktar the Putrescent on Tier 3\tDefeat each boss in the Folly of Nagakhêdi raid on Tier 3 for the Quartermaster. Use the Instance Finder to enter the Folly of Nagakhêdi raid instance.\n2\tSpeak with a Mûr Ghala Quartermaster for your reward\tSpeak with a Mûr Ghala Quartermaster in Adagím or Zajâna to accept your reward.\n",
[14845]="70073DC0\n1\tDefeat Badharál the Gorger on any tier\030Defeat Maukhorn on any tier\030Defeat the Legion of Lhaereth on any tier\030Defeat Zamâktar the Putrescent on any tier\tDefeat each boss in the Folly of Nagakhêdi raid for the Quartermaster. Use the Instance Finder to enter the Folly of Nagakhêdi raid instance.\n2\tSpeak with a Mûr Ghala Quartermaster for your reward\tSpeak with a Mûr Ghala Quartermaster in Adagím or Zajâna to accept your reward.\n",
[14846]="70073DEB\n1\tDeliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to the Traveller's Quartermaster in Bree\030Deliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to the Traveller's Quartermaster in the Twenty-first Hall\030Deliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to the Traveller's Quartermaster at Galtrev\030Deliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to the Adventurer's Quartermaster in the Grey Mountains\030Deliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to any Adventurer's Quartermaster across the world\030Deliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to an Adventurer's Quartermaster in Eriador\030Deliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to the Adventurer's Quartermaster in Gondor\030Deliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to the Adventurer's Quartermaster in Sul Madásh\030Deliver 2500 Embers of Enchantment to the Keeper of Mysteries\tCollect embers and deliver them to Traveller's or Adventurer's Quartermasters found in major settlements throughout the world to earn more virtue.\n",
[14847]="70073F58\n1\tCollect the daffodil bulbs\tAthra wants you take her pot of daffodil bulbs as a reward for your contributions to the festival. You should take the pot of daffodil bulbs near Athra Devister in Clegur.\n2\tThink about what to do with the bulbs\tAthra has given you daffodil bulbs as a reward for your contributions to the festival. You should think about what to do with them.\n3\tGive the daffodil bulbs to Hughbert Larch in Bree-land\tYou remembered Hughbert Larch, the man from Bree who wanted to come to the Daffodil Days festival, but couldn't. You should find him at the Bree-land festival grounds and give the bulbs to him as a gift.\n",
[14848]="70074039\n1\tCollect discarded swords south of Hanamíku (total: 3)\030Collect discarded bags south of Hanamíku (total: 2)\tSwords and bags dropped by fleeing soldiers can be found on the road south of the village of Hanamíku.\n2\tTalk to Urbâru by the road south of Hanamíku\tThe Hamâti soldier Urbâru cradles his wounded arm south of the village of Hanamíku.\n3\tBring the swords and bags you retrieved to Algarâsh by the southern entrance to the village of Hanamíku\tAlgarâsh stands by the southern entrance to the village of Hanamíku.\n",
})
